        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "No judgment here, I promise. I totally get it. That feeling of just... really missing someone can be so heavy. What's making you want to reach out right now? Like, what would you even say if you did text them?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "help me write it. something that doesn't sound desperate. you're good with words, make it good"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I got you. But okay, give me a little context first so I don't steer you wrong. Like, what's the vibe between you two right now? Are we talking like... a messy breakup, or just drifted apart, or you guys fought and haven't spoken in a while? That changes everything."
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "it's almost 1am and the apartment is so quiet and i just want ONE person to want to talk to me you know"
